Dear Zoe,

=20

Will you please tell the judge that you are out of funds and therefore, are=
 unable to carry out the work on my behalf, including the D11 I am currently=
 drafting and which I will submit today.

=20

I asked you several times for a deadline regarding Oxus and received no rep=
ly.

=20

I informed you that I was unwell and that my heartbeat was too fast. I info=
rmed you that my symptoms were unmanageable that I was going to Cromwell Hos=
pital yesterday.=20

=20

I told you I could not accept an open-ended request for the respondent to p=
rovide the information regarding Oxus, and that the absence of a deadline ma=
de me extremely distressed.=20

=20

You did not respond to my emails requesting a deadline for Oxus.

=20

I will be sending the D11 regarding Oxus at the end of the day today.

=20

I will also be addressing Imerman, Coinbase and Forte Securities in the nex=
t few days.

=20

Please advise Ms. Campbell and the judge that I will be emailing everyone b=
ecause you are not in funds.

=20

I will not allow anyone to put my life and my children=E2=80=99s lives into the r=
espondent=E2=80=99s hands.=20

=20

I refuse to be powerless, helpless, and voiceless.=20

I refuse to be cornered.=20

I refuse to be silenced.

=20

=20

With kind wishes,

=20

Nadia

